              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Ch2\u003EImage Carousel Row\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYou can add a simple image carousel to a page by using the Image Carousel Row. In this row you have a multi image picker and you just choose the images you want to display.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
